  "id": "diagnostic-audiometry",
  "term": "diagnostic audiometry",
  "definition": "Diagnostic audiometry is a clinical hearing assessment used to evaluate a person’s hearing status. In the source, it refers to testing done by a licensed audiologist in a soundproof room using standard audiometric procedures and accepted technical standards.",
